   Leader (AA (0,0), AY (3,2), YA (2,3), YY (1,1)); u_1(p,q) = 1 + 2p + q - 4pq, u_2(p,q) = 1 + p + 2q - 4pq
   identities at q = 3/7: u_1(1,q) = 12/7 = 3(1-q), u_2(1,q) = 8/7 = 2(1-q), u_1(0,q) = 10/7 = 1 + q; formula check on a 11x11 grid: True
